{"name": "Hand of Fate: Hordes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HAND OF FATE: HORDES is a new fantasy adventure beyond the 13th Gate. Control powerful heroes and carve your way through dungeons, quests, and endless monsters and bosses. Grow your powers every run with new weapons and enchantments. Choose your cards wisely and thrive in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"192\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/ecdff8a55c5bfa7810fc336c4503575f.webp?t=1787865755\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/ecdff8a55c5bfa7810fc336c4503575f.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to the world of Hand of Fate imprisoned within the Shadow Vaults where the banished Dealer devises your demise. Unravel his dark designs as you carve through endless hordes, deadly quests, and fearsome bosses to break free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master four heroes \u2013 Trickster, Goblin, Warrior, and Rebel \u2013  each with distinct ranged, melee, and magic fighting styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn. Adapt. Conquer. Master every dungeon's layouts, secrets, and special features to make smarter choices and push further with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your powers with new cards, abilities and rewards and twist the dungeons to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By the original indie designers of Hand of Fate\u2122. Starring Hand of Fate's Anthony Skordi as the Dealer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"192\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/29f949e2387288cf3c2e24ba552b58de.webp?t=1787865755\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/29f949e2387288cf3c2e24ba552b58de.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through waves of enemies as your powers grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your skills for each hero. Every card. Every encounter. Every decision could bring you closer to freedom\u2014or deeper into The Dealer\u2019s trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your powers with every run. Unlock new rarities, story Encounters, fantasy melee, ranged, and magic weapons, treasure-filled events, and powerful blessing modifiers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/ae3ef9edf00eabab19259d8c6e498c62.webp?t=1787865755\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/ae3ef9edf00eabab19259d8c6e498c62.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win powerful boons and buffs through card shuffle and dice minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn Tokens that unlock game changing rewards at the end of each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Heroes, Quests, Dungeons, Bosses, and Weapon updates dropped throughout the year. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"192\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "HAND OF FATE: HORDES is a new fantasy adventure beyond the 13th Gate. Control powerful heroes and carve your way through dungeons, quests, and endless monsters and bosses. Grow your powers every run with new weapons and enchantments. Choose your cards wisely and thrive in chaos.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/c719b15e615e9c1d072c6a4f46e44f80a6ca024b/header.jpg?t=1787865755", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Bullet Heaven", "Action Roguelike", "Top-Down Shooter", "Bullet Hell", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "Spitfire Interactive", "publishers": "Spitfire Interactive", "release_date": "Jul 22, 2026", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "3075410", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "22 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7KgQUsPVvc8", "first_seen": 1747864800.0, "review_rank": 1649}